<title>USA: Ampex says has not issued shr-boosting news.</title>
<headline>Ampex says has not issued shr-boosting news.</headline>
<dateline>REDWOOD CITY, Calif. 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ampex Corp said on Thursday it had made no announcements that would account for the rise in its share price, and that it was against its policy to comment on trading activity in its shares.</p>
<p>&quot;The company has not issued any press releases or news today,&quot; an Ampex spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Ampex shares were trading up 2-1/4 at 9-3/8.</p>
